
Panes
	Alt n			new pane.  Splits to right or below depending

	In Pane mode:
		Alt arrows		move between panes
		Alt PageUp/Down		cycle between layouts (?)

Tabs
	Alt l/r				move between tabs
	In Tab mode:
		l/r or j/k		move between tabs

Session
	In Session mode:
		e		edit scrollback in EDITOR


Commands
	ls			list sessions
	a|attach	attach to session
	a -c name	create and attach to session name


Copy on select - default on


